      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i guess. it just feels weird to have this massive amount of money just... guarded by someone else. like, what if something goes wrong with the agent? or what if there's some weird mistake in how they handle the \"holding\" part? is there any way they can just lose it or misuse it?",
